  "sourceTitle": "Japanese Pickles",
  "sourceText": "Japanese Pickles\nBy: Kevin Tu\nPublished: Saturday, January 2, 2010 - 11:56pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n4 Japanese cucumbers thinly sliced\n1 Red onion, thinly sliced\n1/2 cup Rice vinegar\n2 teaspoons Rice syrup\n1/4 teaspoon Salt\n3 Fresh red chili peppers seeded\n2 tablespoons Fresh cilantro\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all ingredients and refrigerate. Serve as a compliment to grilled or spicy foods, or with chicken or fish. 2 Store in a Japanese pickle press.",
  "parsedSource": {
